DICHOTOMY: p=1mod4 -> f=0, a=b, b/(a+b)=1/2 exactly (reflection has no fixed path).
           p=3mod4 -> f>0, a>b by exactly f, b/(a+b)<1/2 ->1/2 (anti-palindromic HPs).
The discriminant is the REVERSAL forced by the anti-automorphism -- the same p mod 4
that gives Borsuk-Ulam(odd) vs Brouwer(even), imaginary vs real, Q(sqrt-p) vs Q(sqrt p).
